  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Providence Transport Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Transporte New Providence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT WILL IMPROVE THE EXISTING ROAD NETWORK, STRENGTHEN THE INSTITUTIONAL FRAMEWORK RESPONSABLE FOR THE PROVISION OF PUBLIC TRANSPORT SERVICES AND TRAFFIC MANAGEMENT, IMPROVE ROAD SAFETY AND ALLEVIATE THE NEGATIVE ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACTS ASSOCIATED WITH EXISTING TRAFFIC CONGESTION LEVELS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
